  '<span class="ctx-badge">Saudi government finances · 2026</span>\n      <span class="ctx-badge upd">New: January–September gap SAR 244 billion (official, 03/11) — the year-end estimate is already used up</span>\n      <span class="ctx-badge war">Houthi attacks now reach Ras Tanura, Rabigh and Riyadh · exports back near pre-war in October</span>',
